&lt;p&gt;We’re seeking a skilled and diligent full-time Software Engineer to join our growing Control Plane Team. You will work as part of the engineering team to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop the Tailscale product, contributing to both open source client code and related backend services;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of the entire product lifecycle, from writing code to product ideation and strategic decision-making;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with UX/UI designers and product managers to shape features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
