&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; Standards:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute component-level input to software architecture decisions and technical standards, working within direction set by senior engineers and technical leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
